{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n啖啖薄荷清香!官方預告出開心果味\n</p>\n<h2>人氣「阿嬤飯團」新推薄荷朱古力雪糕</h2>\n<p>有「被飯糰耽誤的雪糕店」之稱的人氣飯糰雪糕小店「阿嬤飯團」，最近新推出薄荷朱古力口味雪糕$29已經有雙球(單味)、$30(兩款口味)，荃灣及葵芳葵涌廣場同步供應，一推出即在threads上爆紅，掀起排隊人潮！薄荷朱古力口味雪糕食落有啖啖薄荷清香，伴隨著朱古力細碎，吃起來不像香精味牙膏，非常清爽自然。供應期預計到今個月底，想食就要襯早去啦！</p>\n<h2>官方預告出開心果味雪糕！</h2>\n<p>除了薄荷朱古力口味，官方亦宣布將會推出人氣開心果口味雪糕，採用100%開心果製成雪糕，味道香濃，仲會撒上開心果粒粒，非常之期待，大家可以留意官方IG公布發售日期！</p>\n<p>阿嬤飯團<br/>\n葵涌廣場店地址：葵芳葵富路7-11號葵涌廣場1樓潮流廊一期A號舖<br/>\n荃灣店地址：荃灣西樓角路202-216號荃昌中心昌寧商場1樓47號舖</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179299444703227458_11077339816adeec8f75698.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179299444703227458_11077339816adeec8f75698.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179299444927493318_6692621326adeec91e9db8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179299444927493318_6692621326adeec91e9db8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179299445149166700_3264182996adeec93bfc84.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179299445149166700_3264182996adeec93bfc84.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179299445296530591_18168170056adeec9554ad8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179299445296530591_18168170056adeec9554ad8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179299445461388039_15605876266adeec96d64a7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179299445461388039_15605876266adeec96d64a7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179299445619582697_21353730116adeec98bd6fb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179299445619582697_21353730116adeec98bd6fb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179299445830920899_13729255326adeec9ab33f8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179299445830920899_13729255326adeec9ab33f8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/De8e3kPAbFF/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T06:20:37.470722+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":516,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T06:27:32.362255+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T06:18:14.621535+00:00","content_hash":"69a6a0c7d6a1cf71b0abc246677d959d47020d9450b7e3f3a6c31cda